3. ASD-STE100 artifacts: educational-use basis
----------------------------------------------
This repository contains artifacts derived from "ASD-STE100 Simplified
Technical English, Issue 9 (January 2025)":

    - artifacts/ASD-STE100_ISSUE9.pdf
      (the specification document itself)
    - data/dictionary.json, data/lexicon.json, data/rules.json,
      data/manifest.json
      (word list and rules extracted from the specification for research
      use, e.g. building an STE compliance checker)

These artifacts are NOT covered by the MIT license in section 2. They
remain the property of the Aerospace, Security and Defence Industries
Association of Europe (ASD). (c) ASD, 2025. All rights reserved.
"ASD-STE100" is a European Union registered trademark owned by ASD.

They are reproduced here under the irrevocable permission granted in the
"Special usage rights" section of the ASD-STE100 front matter, which gives
"Universities and research institutes for educational purposes"
irrevocable permission to use, reproduce, or publish the document (or any
subsequent modification or revision thereof), in whole or in part, free of
charge.
